sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant API as Search API
    participant Geo as Geospatial index
    participant Biz as Business store
    participant Rev as Review store
    U->>API: businesses near me, filtered
    API->>Geo: query the cells covering this radius
    Note over Geo: quadtree or geohash — a bounding box, then refine by true distance
    Geo-->>API: candidate ids
    API->>Biz: hydrate details
    API->>Rev: aggregate ratings, precomputed
    Note over Rev: never average millions of reviews per request — keep a running aggregate
    API-->>U: ranked results
    U->>Rev: write a review
    Rev->>Rev: update the aggregate asynchronously
